{"t": "n", "id": "fct-bl6gvep2", "rev": 2, "kind": "fact", "key": null, "title": null, "body": "- 2026-10-05: This checkout carries an `upstream` remote (DioxusLabs/blitz) and no `gh repo set-default`, so a bare `gh run` / `gh cache` / `gh api` call reads upstream — on every read of the fork pass `-R Turbolet85/escher` to `gh run` and `gh cache`, give the repo positionally to `gh repo view Turbolet85/escher`, and write it into `gh api`'s path (`repos/Turbolet85/escher/…`), which takes no `-R`. (confidence 0.8) [corrected 2026-11-22: `gh repo view` takes `[<repository>]` and `gh api` lists no `-R`]\n", "data": {"fam": "harness"}}
